Improved: SolverGMRES and SolverFGMRES now use optimized Kokkos kernels
for the classical Gram-Schmidt and the delayed classical Gram-Schmidt
orthogonalization with LinearAlgebra::distributed::Vector in
MemorySpace::Default. The inner products against all basis vectors are
computed in a single sweep with a single synchronization and MPI reduction
per step, and the vector updates are fused into one sweep.
<br>
(Martin Kronbichler, 2026/11/17)
